<section style="
  background-image: url({{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url }});
  background-repeat: repeat;
  background-size: auto;
  padding: 100px 40px;
" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="our-story-container" style="
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  ">

    <!-- 左侧文字内容 -->
    <div style="flex: 1 1 300px;" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100">
      <h2 style="
        font-size: 48px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d9b989, #e2c59a);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        font-family: 'Limelight', serif;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      ">
        OUR STORY
      </h2>

      <p style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #000; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Our founder was born and raised on the storied Loess Plateau of Northern China —<br>
        a land carved by centuries of resilience, trade, and tradition.<br>
        Hailing from Shanxi, once the home of the legendary Jin Merchants, <br>
        he grew up among flavors that spoke of time, craftsmanship, and belonging: <br>
        aged vinegar as dark as ink, robust grain spirits, and the early whispers of mountain-grown wine.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #000; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Years later, under the Californian sun in the heart of Silicon Valley, <br>
        he found himself longing not just for the tastes of home, <br>
        but for the values they embodied — integrity, patience, and cultural richness. <br>
        Out of that longing, TasteEast was born.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #000;">
        More than a brand, TasteEast is a bridge —<br>
        linking the soul of Chinese terroir with American curiosity.<br>
        We hand-select products that reflect the very essence of China’s diverse landscapes and culinary heritage.<br>
        Through wine, tea, vinegar, and more, <br>
        we invite our customers to discover a quiet yet powerful narrative —<br>
        one of elegance, authenticity, and enduring cultural pride.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 右侧图片 -->
    <div style="flex: 1 1 300px; text-align: center;" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="200">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0714/2408/2105/files/c_969fec1b-1dbf-4a67-86e9-3416357184f7.jpg?v=1753701474" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 📱 自适应样式 -->
<style>
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  section[data-aos="fade-up"] {
    padding: 60px 20px !important;
  }

  .our-story-container {
    flex-direction: column !important;
    gap: 40px !important;
  }

  .our-story-container h2 {
    font-size: 32px !important;
    margin-bottom: 16px !important;
    text-align: center !important;
  }

  .our-story-container p {
    font-size: 13px !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
    text-align: left !important;
  }

  .our-story-container img {
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 90vw !important;
    height: auto !important;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story Section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "bg_image",
      "label": "Background Texture"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Our Story",
      "category": "Custom"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
